          "text": "LI T'ang-chieh 李棠階 (T. 樹南, H. 文園, 強齋), Apr. 2, 1798–1865, Dec. 26, official, was a native of Pao-fêng ts'un 保封村 in the district of Ho-nei, Honan. His ancestors were farmers and came originally from Hung-tung, Shansi.",
